  "question": {
    "text": "In the given circuit, a charge of $+80 \\mu C$ is given to the upper plate of the $4 \\mu F$ capacitor. Then in the steady state, the charge on the upper plate of the $3 \\mu F$ capacitor is\r\n\r\n<img src=\" data:image/png;base64,\">"
